// How much of the picture an edit that left the stale paragraphs cvl_r ([first, last]) moved, for a document that had cvi_np pages before: 0 nothing below the paragraphs moved, 1 what is below them moved, 2 the pages changed in number or paragraphs went without any being marked, so everything must be repainted. It compares the paragraph tops now with the ones vw_tp kept from before.
view_input_shift_level(View view_input_movement_view, int[] view_input_movement_range, int view_input_movement_page_count) {
